-- check/bad: `misplaced_ownership_word` (ownership-checker.md §24.4),
-- lowering's: a package that may not write `foreign` may not write ownership
-- words either — thesis Change 5(b) is not approved, and the checker reads a
-- user's declaration from its body. One message per signature, at its first
-- word (7:14), and the signature is read without its words, so the body
-- still checks.
pub joined : borrowed List String, String → fresh String
joined parts separator = String.join parts separator
